        "original_id": "fbb4a8b6-a0f8-59e9-a558-9cbc6369f79c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Sinclair Broadcast Group, ZGS Communications\n- Organizations: WJAR, WRIW-CD, NBC, Telemundo\n- Places: Rhode Island, Bristol County, Massachusetts, Providence, Cranston\n- Topics: television station ownership and affiliation\n\nFacts:\n- WJAR, commonly known as NBC 10, is an NBC-affiliated television station for Rhode Island and Bristol County, Massachusetts, and it is licensed to Providence.\n- WJAR is owned by Sinclair Broadcast Group.\n- WJAR shares studios on Kenney Drive in Cranston with WRIW-CD, a Telemundo affiliate owned by ZGS Communications.\n- Sinclair Broadcast Group is an American telecommunications company.\n- Sinclair Broadcast Group is owned by the family of its founder, Julian Sinclair Smith.",
